Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 02:10:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] fix(routing): remove legacy router from dispatch

- Remove modelRouterService.selectModelForAgent() calls
- Simplify sendChat() to accept pre-routed RuntimeChatRequest
- Simplify sendChatStream() to use broker decision directly
- Use request.model_id and request.slot_id from frontend
- Eliminate redundant routing in dispatch path

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 apps/desktop/src/services/agentRunService.ts | 78 ++------------------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)

